# 🔴 THE ORDER OF THESE THREE LINES IS LOAD-BEARING, and it was wrong until 2026-09-12.
# The pattern on the second line matches the example file too, so the one document listing every
# variable this service needs was silently absent from every clone — while README.md told people
# to copy it. The negation restores it. A real secrets file stays ignored.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
